# Renders and their by-products. render.py writes a 24-bit WAV beside itself and
# check.py writes a spectrogram PNG; the 5- and 10-minute renders are ~88 MB and
# ~175 MB, which is not what a repository is for. The published audio is the
# FLAC and MP3 one level up, and line-probe-5.json / line-probe-10.json record
# what those renders did.
*.wav
*.reapeaks
*-spectrogram.png
__pycache__/
